            "review_text": "Андрей\nPerm, Russia28 contributions\n0\nCappuccino for every day!\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nWe came in after accidentally noticing leaflets with reviews on the walls of the cafe. We had this experience in Thailand and Vietnam before: mostly Russian-speaking visitors write, and the rest “for company”\nFamily cafe, everyone works from primary schoolchildren. They try very hard, everything is clean and tidy! Fast service, everything is delicious! The only soup (Pho) is not the best option in Nha Trang, it seemed that it came with a cube of broth. The rest of the menu is always perfect and leaves you wanting to order again!\nYou are allowed to drink your own alcohol, but somehow it looks unattractive when they run across the road for a bottle and sit there refilling from a bag😱 the hostess is as friendly as possible, but you shouldn’t abuse it🙏\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten March 4, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
