            "review_title": "Review at Cappuccino",
            "review_text": "JanetR001\nNorth Yorkshire, United Kingdom331 contributions\n0\nBad experience\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nJust wanted a snack to eat and ordered a tuna salad, garlic bread and chips tonight along with 2 beers.\nUnfortunately there were hardly any chips when they arrived 10 mins before anything else and then when the tuna salad arrived there was less than a teaspoon of tuna on the plate. I asked where it was and the lady pointed to the speck that was on my plate and I asked for more. \nI could tell she wasn't happy. Eventually after my partner went to her again in the kitchen to ask for more she sent what I presume was her son with a couple more pieces of tuna.....didn't really make it a tuna salad!\nAnyway we paid what was asked .shame she couldn't face us to bring the bill but sent her very young daughter ..... unfortunately a bad experience but maybe that's what you get when you just fancied a little bit of western food after a month or so away or maybe it's because we weren't russian and spending a lot of money...not sure but won't be returning\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 24, 2024",
