            "review_title": "Review at Cappuccino",
            "review_text": "Sarze-J\nHunter Valley, Australia1179 contributions\n0\nOpen late\nJul 2018 • Family\nMy family was looking for somewhere to go for dinner, it was nearing 10pm and a lot of places near the beach were closing so we started walking up towards our Villa and came across this restaurant. I was told that it was open till late so we grabbed a table, the staff were accomodating and friendly. Drinks were served nice and quick and our meals weren’t far behind. My chicken breast with creamy mushroom and bacon sauce was really enjoyable and cooked perfect. My partner had gnocchi which she enjoyed and are boys said their crumbed chicken and calamari was delicious. My Father in law had a burger and it was huge, he wasn’t a fan of the meat patty which our 13 year old ended up finishing and liked. I’m basing this review off my dish and service which I thought was good. If we ever travelled to Nah Trang again I would return.\nRead more\nWritten July 11, 2018",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
