            "review_text": "Louise 🌍TRAVEL BLOGGER🛫\nManchester, United Kingdom562 contributions\n1\nCheap but poor service\nSep 2017 • Couples\nI must first say that my partner and a friend ordered pizzas and they looked very good. Also much bigger than most in restaurants here. I however am lactose intolerant. I ordered the chicken burger and translated to the waitress that I cannot have dairy, no butter, no milk etc. She said it was fine. When my burger came it was covered in butter. I called the waitress over and she said 'the chicken is cooked in butter.' I asked why she didn't tell me this when I ordered it, after me telling her dairy will make me sick. The burger itself was also very small and there were about 10 fries on the plate. I ordered another standard Vietnamese meal and it was ok, although the portion was very small.\nRead more\nWritten September 13, 2017",
